{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>REDVERY SPACE: An immersive space flight simulation</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2974010/extras/37956670779409926f1ea239fac7ceb7.poster.avif?t=1755210198\" width=500 height=280 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2974010/extras/37956670779409926f1ea239fac7ceb7.webm?t=1755210198\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2974010/extras/37956670779409926f1ea239fac7ceb7.mp4?t=1755210198\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Into the unknown</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A newly discovered wormhole at the edge of our solar system could lead to uncharted space, rich with resources and unknown phenomena. Probes have failed to return, leaving vital questions unanswered. The anomaly\u2019s instability requires a skilled pilot for further exploration.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2974010/extras/85dadcb93a64d74940d83eb5fc0b42ac.avif?t=1755210198\" width=600 height=219 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Your mission</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Over the last decade, we have designed <strong>REDVERY RX3</strong>, a cutting-edge spacecraft optimized for deep space exploration. Your mission: Explore the universe, find shortcuts in wormholes, document discoveries, and, if possible, return with critical data.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2974010/extras/rx3.png?t=1755210198\" width=600 height=219 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Explore the universe your way</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It's an open world. You\u2019ll navigate solar systems, manage limited resources, and adapt to unpredictable challenges. Every decision matters. Success depends on your ingenuity and courage. Are you ready to venture into the unknown?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2974010/extras/9b5a940d9fcc155492171f00e0c31f85.poster.avif?t=1755210198\" width=600 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2974010/extras/9b5a940d9fcc155492171f00e0c31f85.webm?t=1755210198\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2974010/extras/9b5a940d9fcc155492171f00e0c31f85.mp4?t=1755210198\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2974010?t=1755210198","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2974010?t=1755210198","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2974010/ef2c7cf4119a6e3ca88a192ff400b51076b1ed8c/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1755210198","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2974010/ef2c7cf4119a6e3ca88a192ff400b51076b1ed8c/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1755210198","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Camera Comfort","id":67},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Keyboard Only Option","id":75},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"descripti