ormholes, document discoveries, and, if possible, return with critical data.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2974010/extras/rx3.png?t=1755210198\" width=600 height=219 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Explore the universe your way</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It's an open world. You\u2019ll navigate solar systems, manage limited resources, and adapt to unpredictable challenges. Every decision matters. Success depends on your ingenuity and courage. Are you ready to venture into the unknown?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2974010/extras/9b5a940d9fcc155492171f00e0c31f85.poster.avif?t=1755210198\" width=600 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2974010/extras/9b5a940d9fcc155492171f00e0c31f85.webm?t=1755210198\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2974010/extras/9b5a940d9fcc155492171f00e0c31f85.mp4?t=1755210198\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","developers":["REDVERY e.K."],"genres":[{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2974010/header.jpg?t=1755210198","is_free":false,"legal_notice":"REDVERY is a registered trademark of REDVERY e.K. \u00a9 2022 \u2013 2025.","linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Ubuntu 22.04 (64 bit) or higher<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel i5-3570K or AMD equivalent<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Nvidia GTX 780 or AMD equivalent<br></li><l